<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Mika bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Mika</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mik</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Mika bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Mika xa kitaabui nɔndi hagigɛ masenma to mixie bɛ. Ala mu wama fe ɲaaxi xɔn, a yunubi birin xɔnma a bɔɲɛ birin na. Na kui ibunadama na keli Ala xa kira xɔn ma, Ala xa tinxinyi a niyama nɛ a xa na mixie ɲaxankata e xa fe rabaxi ma. E na findi a xa ɲama ra, e na findi ɲama ra naxan mu a kolon, e birin halakima nɛ na yunubie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na fahaamufe mu xɔrɔxɔ adamadie bɛ, barima e fan na fe ɲaaxi nde to, e bɔɲɛ tema nɛ han. E na a to e xa mangɛe na setaree tɔɔrɔfe alako nde xa sa e yɛtɛ xa naafuli xɔn ma, e xɔnɔma nɛ. Na xɔnɛ maniya Ala xa xɔnɛ tinxinxi ra. Fe naxan mu rafan Ala ma, fe fanyi mu a ra. A mixi tɔɔrɔma nɛ!</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔnɔ Ala xa xɔnɛ fatanxi a xa bɔɲɛ fanyi nan na. A to wa ibunadama xa fe xa sɔɔnɛya, a na Sentanɛ xa kasarɛ wali to, a xɔnɔma nɛ, a man gere ti na xili ma. Yunubi raba ɲaxankatafe kelixi na nan ma. Kɔnɔ na bɔɲɛ fanyi man a niyama nɛ Alatala xa katɛ birin naba alako a xa ibunadama ragbilen a xa kira fanyi ma. A mu wama e ɲaxankatafe tun. A wama nɛ e xa gbilen a ma, e xa kisi sɔtɔ kira fanyi xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Mika nu Ala xa masenyi tife Isirayila nun e yaxuie bɛ, kɔnɔ a tide gbo to mixie fan bɛ. Won fan xa fahaamui sɔtɔ yi masenyi kui: a yunubi mu rafan Ala ma, a fama yunubitɔɛe ɲaxankatade, a nun a wama mixi rakisife e xa yunubie ma alako e xa ɲɛrɛ a waxɔnfe fanyi kui. Ala xa won mali na kisi tinxinxi sɔtɔfe ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Mika bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa xɔnɛ Isirayila nun Yudaya bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya a naxan ti Annabi Mika Moresetika bɛ Samari nun Darisalamu xa fe ra. A a ti a bɛ Yudaya mangɛ Yotami, Axasi, nun Xesekiya xa waxati nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Duniɲa si birin, wo xa wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Ibunadama birin naxee na yi bɛndɛ fuɲi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">wo xa n ma masenyi ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">won Marigi Alatala fama wo kalamude naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">kelife a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi kui.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Wo xa a mato, Alatala na fafe kelife a xa lingira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:3">a na gorofe geyae fari, a a ɲɛrɛ.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Geyae na xunufe a sanyi bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">alɔ kumi dole naxan sama tɛ fɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">alɔ ye naxan susufe kelife yire itexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">Geyae na ibɔɔfe, e findi gulunbae ra.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Na birin kelixi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xa murutɛ nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">a fatanxi Isirayila ɲama xa yunubie nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Nde Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛe ramurutaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Samari xa mu a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Nde kuye batude tixi yire itexi fari Yudaya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Darisalamu xa mu a ra?<verse eid="MIC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Na kui n fama Samari findide gɛmɛ malanxie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">n a findi wɛni sansi side ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">N a xa gɛmɛ bilie rabira, n e radin gulunbae kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">han a xa banxie bunyi lu kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="MIC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />N a xa kuyee butuxunma nɛ, n a xa batu see ganma nɛ tɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">n a xa ala masolixie xun nakanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">Nee fɔlɔxi bafata nan na naxan nawalixi langoe sare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">nee man findima bafata nan na langoe sare fima naxan na.<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />N fama sunnunde na nan ma, n na n kui iwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">N na n ɲɛrɛma nɛ n sanyi nun n fate mageli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">n na n gbelegbele xui itema nɛ alɔ wulai bare,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">n na n kui iwa alɔ xundi.<verse eid="MIC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Samari xa fure ɲaaxi mu nɔma dandande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">a man bara din Yudaya bɔxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">han a bara Darisalamu masɔtɔ n ma ɲama sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Wo naxa na fe rakolon Gatikae ra de wo wa xui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">N dɔxɔxi xube xɔɔra sunnunyi kui Beti Leyafera.<verse eid="MIC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Safirikae, wo xa dangi wo mageli ra yaagi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Saanan ɲama mu suusama minide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Wo mu nɔma wo xaxili tide Beti Eseli ra, e fan na wafe.<verse eid="MIC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />Marotikae bara lu kɔntɔfili kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">barima gbaloe bara goro kelife e Marigi Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">a Darisalamu naadɛ li.<verse eid="MIC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Lakisikae, wo xa sɔɔri ragisee yailan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">Wo bara a niya Siyonikae xa muruta Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">Isirayila bara bira wo xa yunubie fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MIC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />I tan nun Moreseti Gatikae fatanma na nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:14">Akisibukae fama nɛ Isirayila mangɛe yanfade.<verse eid="MIC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Maresakae, n gerefa gbɛtɛ xɛɛma nɛ a xa wo gere.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">Isirayila mangɛ ɲalama sigama nɛ Adulama.<verse eid="MIC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Wo wo xunyie bi alɔ yubɛ, sunnunyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">barima wo xa di xanuxie fama xaninde konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ nun kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">naxee e maɲɔxunma maifuya nun fe ɲaaxi rabafe ma e sa tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">kuye nɛfɛ iba, e fa fe kobie raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">barima na nɔɛ na e yi ra.<verse eid="MIC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />E na milɛ xɛe ma, e nee ba e kanyie yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">E na milɛ banxie ma, e nee tongo e sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">E fu mixi ma, e a xa banxi muɲa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">E fu mixi ma, e a kɛ rasuxu a yi.<verse eid="MIC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Na xa fe ra, Marigi Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">«N ɲaxankatɛ dɔxɔma nɛ na mixi mɔɔli ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">wo mu nɔma wo ratangade naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">N fama wo xun gorode na ɲaxankatɛ tɛmui.<verse eid="MIC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />E wo xa fe ifalama taali daaxi nɛ na lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">e wo masigi a mayele ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">e nu fa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">‹Muxu xa fe bara kana feo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Muxu xa bɔxie bara ba muxu yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">A bara e ba muxu yi, a e so muxu yaxuie yi ra.›»<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Na nan a ra, wo mu mixi yo sɔtɔma Alatala xa ɲama ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:5">naxan nɔma bɔxi itaxunde wo bɛ Ala xa tɔnxumae saabui ra.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />E xa namiɲɔnmɛe a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">«Ba yi masenyi mɔɔli tife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">namiɲɔnmɛ mu lanma a xa na fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">Won mu fama lude yaagi yo kui.<verse eid="MIC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, a lanma a xa fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Alatala xɔnɔma a bɔɲɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">A darixi na wali mɔɔli raba ra?»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 2:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Alatala naxa e yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">«N ma masenyie mu fanxi xɛ tinxintɔɛe bɛ?<verse eid="MIC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />Yi waxati n ma ɲama bara lu alɔ n yaxui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">Wo donma fanyi bama dangi mixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">naxee fafe bɔɲɛsa kui kelife gere sode.<verse eid="MIC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Wo n ma ɲama xa ginɛe kerima e xa banxi fanyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">wo e xa die xa xunnakeli bama e yi ra n naxan fi e ma.<verse eid="MIC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Wo keli, wo siga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">n bara yi bɔxi ba wo yi ra sabatide ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">barima a mu sɛniyɛn, a bara kana kerenyi ra.<verse eid="MIC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />Xa wule falɛ nun mixi madaxui fa a fala wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">‹Wo fama beere nun wɛni sɔtɔde›,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">na mixi mɔɔli nan nafan wo ma namiɲɔnmɛ ra.»<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />«Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, n wo birin malanma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">Isirayila mixi dɔnxɔɛe, n wo xun lanma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">N wo malanma nɛ, alɔ yɛxɛɛe naxee malanma gɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">alɔ xurusee naxee na fiili ma e dɛ madonde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">Ɲama gbegbe sabatima nɛ naa.<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />E xa mangɛ fama nɛ taa tɛtɛ ibɔɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">a fa ti ɲama ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">a e birin naminima nɛ naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Alatala nan findi e xunyi ra.»<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila yareratie xa yunubie</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />N naxɛ, «Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ mangɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">Isirayila yareratie, wo xa wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">Wo tan xa mu daxa wo xa sɛriyɛ kolon?<verse eid="MIC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />Kɔnɔ wo fe fanyie xɔnma, fe ɲaaxie nan nafan wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">Wo mixie tɔɔrɔma han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">a luxi nɛ alɔ wo e xa kiri nun sube bama e fatee ma,<verse eid="MIC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />wo na ibolon a xuntunyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">wo a ɲin tunde kui, wo fa a don.»<verse eid="MIC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Na mixi mɔɔli fama nɛ Alatala xilide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">kɔnɔ a mu e yaabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">Na lɔxɔɛ a a kobe soma nɛ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">barima e ɲɛrɛ ki mu fan.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">«Wo tan namiɲɔnmɛ naxee n ma ɲama ratantanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">naxee bɔɲɛsa masenma mixie bɛ naxee wo kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">kɔnɔ wo mixie tan gere naxee wo kuma.<verse eid="MIC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />Na xa fe ra, kɔɛ soma nɛ wo xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">wo mu toe tima, wo mu laamatunyie sɔtɔma, wo luma dimi nan kui tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">Soge dulama nɛ na namiɲɔnmɛe xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">yanyi fan ifɔɔrɔ e bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Se matoe yaagima nɛ, naxee yare toma, e xun sinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">e e yatagi nɔxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">barima n tan Ala mu e yaabima.»<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi bara sɛnbɛ fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">tinxinyi nun limaniya bara lu n yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">alako n xa Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛe rakolon e xa murutɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">n xa Isirayila xa yunubie masen a bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Wo tan Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛe yareratie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">wo tan Isirayila ɲama xa mangɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">wo xa wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">Wo na tinxinyi xɔnfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">wo a mafindi.<verse eid="MIC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />Wo na mixie nii bafe Siyoni tife ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:10">wo na Darisalamu tife tinxintareya kui.<verse eid="MIC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />E xa mangɛe kiiti sama kɔbiri sɔtɔfe nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">E xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xaranyi tima naafuli xa fe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">E xa namiɲɔnmɛe masenyie tima e xa geeni nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Kɔnɔ e birin e ya tima Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">e nu a fala mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">«Alatala mu na xɛ won ya ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Ɲaxankatɛ yo mu won lima.»<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />Wo xa fe nan yati a niyama Siyoni fama buxade alɔ xɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">Darisalamu findima nɛ gɛmɛ malanxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">fɔtɔnyi fa bula hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi ma.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa xunnakeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Tɛmui fama a lide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">Alatala xa banxi tixi geya naxan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">na fama nɛ tide geya birin xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">A itema nɛ tentenyi birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">ɲamae luma nɛ siga ra mɛnni.<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />Si gbegbe e xun tima nɛ naa ra, e a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">«Won xa siga Alatala xa geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Yaxuba Marigi Ala xa banxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">A won xaranma nɛ a xa sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">alako won xa won ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 4:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Sɛriyɛ fatanma Siyoni nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Alatala xa masenyi kelima Darisalamu nan kui.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />A findima nɛ kiitisa ra si gbegbe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">a fa si sɛnbɛmae xa gere raɲɔnde duniɲa birin kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">E e xa santidɛgɛmae xabuma sari xa kerie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">e e xa wɔrɔtɛe yailan tanbɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Si yo mu a xa santidɛgɛma itema si gbɛtɛ xili ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Na waxati, mixie mu gere mɔɔli yo matinkanma.<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />E tima e xa wɛni sansi nan sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">e dɔxɔ e xa xɔrɛ bili niini bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">Mixi yo mu fama e bɔɲɛ raminide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">barima Alatala Sɛnbɛma bara wɔyɛn.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Si birin nɔma ɲɛrɛde e xa alae waxɔn ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:5">kɔnɔ won tan won ɲɛrɛma Alatala nan waxɔn ki abadan.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />Alatala naxa a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">«Lɔxɔɛ nde fama, n lanyurutɔɛe malanma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">N mixie xunlanma nɛ, n naxee rayensenxi tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="MIC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />N lanyurutɔɛe findima nɛ mixi kisixi dɔnxɔɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">n mixi rayensenxie findima nɛ si sɛnbɛma ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">Alatala nan tima e xun ma Siyoni geya fari abadan.<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />I tan Siyoni, naxan a ɲɔxɔ sama ɲama xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">naxan findixi taa makanta xi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">nɔɛ fisamante gbilenma i tan nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">mangɛya fa lu Darisalamu yi ra.»<verse eid="MIC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Wo fa gbelegbelema munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Mangɛ mu na wo xɔnyi sɔnɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Wo rasima bara faxa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Na bara a niya wo xa tɔɔrɔ alɔ ginɛ naxan na ditinyi ra?<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Siyonikae, wo furie xa wo matolin alɔ furi ginɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">barima e wo raminima nɛ taa kui, wo fa xi burunyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">E wo xaninma Babilɔn konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">kɔnɔ mɛnni wo fama nɛ fulunde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Alatala wo bama nɛ wo yaxuie bɛlɛxɛ i.<verse eid="MIC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi si gbegbe tixi wo xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">a falafe ra, «Siyoni xa yaagi won ya xɔri!»<verse eid="MIC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Nee mu Alatala xa maɲɔxunyi kolonxi, e mu a xa wali fahaamuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">Alatala bara e malan lonyi ma maale bɔnbɔma dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />Siyonikae, wo keli wo xa e bɔnbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">N wo sɛnbɛ gboma nɛ alɔ tuura,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">naxan ferie yailanxi wure ra, naxan tore findixi wure gbeeli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Na kui wo ɲamanɛ wuyaxi butuxunma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">wo e xa naafuli findima n tan Duniɲa Marigi Alatala nan gbe ra.<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 4:14" />Yakɔsi wo xa wo fatee mabɔɔ sunnunyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:14">barima e na won ma taa suxufe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:14">e na Isirayila ɲama xa mangɛ bɔnbɔfe a yatagi ma wuri ra.<verse eid="MIC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila Nakisima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />«I tan, Bɛtɛlɛɛmu Efarata, naxan xurun Yuda xabilɛe ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">mixi nde minima nɛ i ya ma naxan Isirayila yamarima n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">A xa fe fɔlɔxi tɛmui dangixi nɛ naxan makuya pon.»<verse eid="MIC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />Na na a toma, Alatala Isirayila raboloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">han furi ginɛ fa a xa di baride.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">Na tɛmui, na di ngaxakerenyie dɔnxɔɛe fama nɛ gbilende Isirayila.<verse eid="MIC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />A kelima nɛ, a ti a xa xurusee ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">a e dɛ madon a Marigi Alatala Xili Xungbe Kanyi sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">E sabatima nɛ a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">barima a xa xunnakeli duniɲa birin lima nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />A tan nan findima won ma bɔɲɛsa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">Asiriyakae na fa won ma bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">e so won ma yire makantaxie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">won kantama solofere nun mangɛ solomasaxan nan kelima e xili ma.<verse eid="MIC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />E Asiriya bɔxi yamarima nɛ santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">e dɔxɔ Nimirodi xa bɔxi xun ma tanbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">Won ma mangɛ won bama nɛ Asiriyakae yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">e na tugan won ma naaninyi xun ma, e so won ma bɔxi kui.<verse eid="MIC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛe luma nɛ duniɲa sie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">alɔ xini naxan kelima Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">alɔ tunɛ ye naxan dɔxɔma burɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">E mu e xaxili tima ibunadama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">e mu e yɛtɛ taxuma mixi yo ra.<verse eid="MIC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛe luma nɛ duniɲa si gbegbe ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">alɔ yɛtɛ naxan tima wulai subee tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">alɔ yɛtɛ yɔrɛ naxan ɲɛrɛma xurusee ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">a fa dutun ndee ma, a e ibɔɔ, mixi yo mu nɔma e bade a yi ra.<verse eid="MIC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />I xun nakelima nɛ i yaxuie ya i, e birin sɔntɔ.<verse eid="MIC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Alatala naxa a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">«Lɔxɔ nde fama a lide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">n wo xa soee nun wo xa sɔɔri ragisee xa fe kanama nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />N wo xa bɔxi xa taae kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:10">n wo xa yire makantaxie rabira.<verse eid="MIC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />N wo xa duureya kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:11">n wo xa se matoe rayensen yɛ.<verse eid="MIC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />N wo xa kuyee nun wo xa gɛmɛ masolixi birin kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:12">Na tɛmui, wo mu suyidima se yailanxie bɛ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="MIC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />N wo xa Aseri wuri masolixie talama nɛ wo tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:13">n wo xa taae kanama nɛ,<verse eid="MIC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />n n gbeɲɔxɔma xɔnɛ nan kui, sie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:14">naxee mu tin n xui suxude.»<verse eid="MIC 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa kalamui</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">«Keli, wo xa wo xa kalamui ti geyae ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">duniɲa birin xa i xui mɛ.<verse eid="MIC 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />Geya naxee na duniɲa ma kabi a fɔlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">wo xa n tan Alatala xa kalamui mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">n naxan tima n ma ɲama Isirayila xili ma.»<verse eid="MIC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />«N ma ɲama, n munse rabaxi wo ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">N kote mundun dɔxɔxi wo xun ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">Wo xa n yaabi.<verse eid="MIC 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />N wo raminixi nɛ Misira bɔxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">n wo xun sara konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">N naxa Munsa, Haruna, nun Mariyama xɛɛ wo raminide.<verse eid="MIC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />N ma ɲama, wo xa wo ratu a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">Mowaba mangɛ Balaki nu wama naxan nabafe wo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">a nun Beyori xa di Balami xa yaabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">Wo xa wo ratu wo xa biyaasi ma kelife Sitimi han Giligali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">Alatala xa fe tinxinxie a naxee rabaxi wo bɛ.»<verse eid="MIC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />N fama munse ra Alatala bɛ n xa Mangɛ Ala batu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">A lanma n xa fa sɛrɛxɛ nan na a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi alɔ ninge naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ?<verse eid="MIC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Alatala wama yɛxɛɛ kontonyi gali nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">xa na mu a ra, ture gbegbe naxan mu ɲɔnma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">A lanma n xa n ma di singe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra n ma yunubi sare ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">N di naxan sɔtɔ, na nɔma findide na xafari se ra?<verse eid="MIC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Ala bara adamadi rakolon fe ra naxan fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">a wama i xa naxan naba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">A wama nɛ i xa tinxin, dugutɛgɛya xa rafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">i man xa bira Alatala fɔxɔ ra yɛtɛ magore kui.<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Alatala na taakae xilife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">Xaxilima fama na tode, a fa gaaxu Ala ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">«Wo wo tuli mati a xa kiiti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">wo naxa wo kobe so na kiitisa ra.<verse eid="MIC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Naafuli na wo xɔnyi wo naxan sɔtɔ tinxintareya kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">Maniya se kamalitaree na wo xɔnyi n naxee xɔnxi?<verse eid="MIC 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />N nɔma diɲɛde maniya se tinxintaree kanyi ma?<verse eid="MIC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Taa bannae findixi fe kobi rabae nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:12">taakae wule nan tun falama, e mixie madaxu.»<verse eid="MIC 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />«Na kui n bara wo tɔɔrɔ fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:13">n xa wo halaki wo xa yunubie xa fe ra.<verse eid="MIC 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Wo wo dɛgema nɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu fama lugade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">wo donse ragatama nɛ, kɔnɔ a mu luma naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">Na bama nɛ wo yi ra santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="MIC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Wo xɛ sama nɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu a xabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">wo oliwi bogi bunduma nɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu a ture donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">wo wɛni bogi dunduma nɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu a minma.<verse eid="MIC 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />Wo bira nɛ Omiri xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">wo Akabu xa naamunyie findi wo gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">N wo sɔntɔma na nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">n wo xa ɲama findima nɛ mayele se ra duniɲa ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">n wo luma nɛ yaagi kui sie tagi.»<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ nun a xa kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />N na tɔɔrɔfe yi ki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">N luxi nɛ alɔ mixi naxan sigama sansi bogi bade a ba tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">kɔnɔ a mu wɛni bogi toma naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">a mu xɔrɛ fanyi lima wuri kɔn na alɔ a wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Ala xanuntenyie bara ɲɔn bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">tinxintɔɛ keren mu luma naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">E birin na e boore tɔɔrɔfe a ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">kankan gantanyi tema a ngaxakerenyi bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />E birin fata fe ɲaaxi rabade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">Mangɛe, nee wama buɲa tinxintare xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">Kiitisae, nee kiiti sama kɔbiri nan tun ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">Kuntigie, nee fan e xa wasabaliya masenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">E birin na fe keren nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Naxan na fisamante ra wo ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">na tan luma nɛ alɔ tunbe xɔnɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 7:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Ala xa kiiti lɔxɔɛ bara a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">alɔ ɲama makantɛ a fala ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Ɲama bɔɲɛ mini tɛmui bara fa.<verse eid="MIC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />Wo naxa la wo dɛ fan boore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">wo naxa la wo xanuntenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">hali wo xa ginɛ naxan a sama wo fɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">wo naxa wo xa gundo birin masen a bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />Na waxati di xɛmɛ a baba maberema nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">di ginɛ ti a nga kanke i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">mamadi nun a xa mɔri nga kɔnɲɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">Kankan yaxui findima a bari boore yati nan na.<verse eid="MIC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Kɔnɔ n tan, n ya tima Alatala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">n na n xaxili tima n nakisima Ala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">barima n Marigi n xui suxuma nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />I tan Isirayila yaxui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">i naxa ɲɛlɛxin n ma tɔɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Hali n bira nɛ, n man kelima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Hali n lu nɛ dimi xɔɔra, Alatala nan na n ma yanbɛ ra.<verse eid="MIC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />N to yunubi raba Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">n fama nɛ a xa xɔnɛ sɔtɔde han a kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">a fa n xun mafalade, a a xa tinxinyi masen n bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />N yaxuie na na to, e yaagima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">Singe e nu a falama, «I Marigi Alatala na minden?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">Kɔnɔ na tɛmui n tan nan e xa birɛ toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">e maboron sanyi ra alɔ boora naxan na kira ra.<verse eid="MIC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />I tan Isirayila, wo xa tɛtɛ rakeli lɔxɔɛ fama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:11">wo xa naaninyie igboma nɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />Na lɔxɔɛ mixie fama nɛ wo yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kelife Asiriya nun Misira taae kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kelife Misira bɔxi han Efirati xure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kelife baa nde ma a sa dɔxɔ baa gbɛtɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kelife geya nde ma a sa dɔxɔ geya gbɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="MIC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Duniɲa bɔxi fama nɛ kanade mixie xa wali ɲaaxie xa fe ra.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Mɛɛni i xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">barima e findixi i kɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">naxee sabatixi e kerenyi ma fɔtɔnyi kui fiili fanyi sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">E xa e dɛ madon a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">alɔ e nu a rabaxi Basan nun Galadi bɔxi ma tɛmui dangixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />N kaabanakoe masenma nɛ e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:15">alɔ e mini Misira bɔxi ra lɔxɔɛ naxɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Sie na wo sɛnbɛ to, e yaagima nɛ e xa sɛnbɛtareya kui.<verse eid="MIC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />E xube donma nɛ alɔ bɔximase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">e luma gaaxui nan kui won Marigi Alatala ya ra, e fa sɛrɛn.<verse eid="MIC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />Ala mundun na naxan maniya i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">naxan yunubi xafarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">naxan diɲɛma a xa kɛ tongomae dɔnxɔɛe ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">I mu xɔnɛ ragatama abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">barima dugutɛgɛya masenfe muxu bɛ a rafan i ma.<verse eid="MIC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />I man kinikinima nɛ muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">i fama nɛ muxu xa yunubie lude naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">i fa e woli baa bɔtini ma.<verse eid="MIC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />I i xui rakamalima nɛ Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:20">i hinnɛma nɛ Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:20">alɔ i i kali a ra muxu benbae bɛ ki naxɛ tɛmui dangixi.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>